BT /F2 16 Tf 0.06 0.32 0.43 rg 1 0 0 1 49 739 Tm (06 / The transition has already begun) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 49 709 Tm (An AI-first PC need not replace the familiar desktop overnight. Keyboard, mouse, browser, terminal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 49 693 Tm (and professional applications will remain useful. The shift is in the relationship between person and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 49 677 Tm (machine: from issuing low-level instructions to supervising higher-level work.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 49 649 Tm (A practical system still needs a competent CPU, secure operating-system foundations and an effective) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 49 633 Tm (GPU. It also needs abundant memory, strong support for local inference, and agents that can act) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 49 617 Tm (responsibly rather than merely answer questions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 49 589 Tm (This is where the opportunity lies for companies able to combine hardware and software into one) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 49 573 Tm (coherent experience. AMD has much of the technology. NVIDIA has a mature AI software ecosystem.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 49 557 Tm (Others are advancing unified-memory designs. The eventual winner may be the one that makes the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 49 541 Tm (complete experience simplest and most dependable.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 49 513 Tm (The PC is not disappearing. The assumption that the human must operate every part of it may be.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 49 485 Tm (The future of personal computing is not just a faster machine with an AI feature added on top. It is a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 49 469 Tm (computer designed from the ground up to understand objectives, use tools, and work alongside its) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 49 453 Tm (owner - locally, efficiently and under human control.) Tj ET
